@Jozkee how about just changing `FileStream.DisposeAsync` to:

```cs
public async override ValueTask DisposeAsync()
{
    await _strategy.DisposeAsync().ConfigureAwait(false);
    await base.DisposeAsync().ConfigureAwait(false);
}
```

the simpler the fix, the better as we are going to backport it to 6.0 and 7.0

I just saw #82186, @jozkee could you please add a test for that and change the order of disposal?

```cs
public async override ValueTask DisposeAsync()
{
    await base.DisposeAsync().ConfigureAwait(false);
